  "changelogV180": "Filters grouped in a menu, each with its own title\nSummary of your chosen filters always visible on mobile\nA lighter top bar on mobile and tablet\nOn desktop, filters stay visible on the left",
  "changelogV170": "Share a player's stats with a simple link\nStats on rated games, or on all games if you prefer\nLosses on time shown in time management\nA clearer monthly recap",
  "share": "Share",
  "shareText": "{username}'s stats on Chess Stats",
  "@shareText": {
    "placeholders": {
      "username": {
        "type": "String"
      }
    }
  },
  "shareCopied": "Link copied",
  "shareLinkTitle": "Link to share",
  "playerLoading": "Loading games…",
  "changelogV160": "Your monthly recap as slides, the first time you look up a player, and to replay from the stats page\nShared filters at the top of the page: time control, colour and opening\nOpening names translated and grouped more accurately\nOne rating curve per time control, and by colour",
  "@changelogV160": {
    "description": "Nouveautés de la version 1.6.0, une par ligne."
  },
  "changelogV150": "New \"Game phases\" card: see where your games are decided, from the opening to the endgame\nYour time left against your opponent's, at a glance, after the opening and in the endgame\nYour endgame results by material and by type of endgame\nFaster page: the longest stats show up a moment later",
  "@changelogV150": {
    "description": "Nouveautés de la version 1.5.0, une par ligne."
  },
  "changelogV140": "Stats for the last month or the last 3 months, your choice\nFaster display: each player's games are kept in your browser\nSearch: players you already looked up are suggested\nCleaner, more compact page, especially on mobile",
  "@changelogV140": {
    "description": "Nouveautés de la version 1.4.0, une par ligne."
  },
  "changelogV130": "New \"Playing hours\" card: a 24-hour dial of this month's games by start time, in your local time\n\"Activity\" mode: number of games per hour, in shades of blue\n\"Performance\" mode: score per hour, from red to green through yellow (at least 5 games per hour)\nBest and weakest time slots: one click shows them on the dial\nTap an hour to see its details in a bubble",
  "@changelogV130": {
    "description": "Nouveautés de la version 1.3.0, une par ligne."
  },
  "changelogV121": "Faster loading: each opponent's country is requested only once, several at a time, and remembered for a month in your browser",
  "@changelogV121": {
    "description": "Nouveautés de la version 1.2.1, une par ligne."
  },
  "changelogV120": "Countries map: new \"Performance\" map, from red (losses) to green (wins) through yellow (even)\nCountries with too few games in grey: 2 games minimum, 3 above 40 games in the month\nStrengths and weaknesses: markers on the map and a summary under the legend",
  "@changelogV120": {
    "description": "Nouveautés de la version 1.2.0, une par ligne."
  },
  "changelogV110": "Desktop display: statistics on two columns on large screens\nPage title centered on every page\nPlayed openings and opponents' countries: paginated tables, 5 rows per page\nFooter with the version number and what's new",
  "@changelogV110": {
    "description": "Nouveautés de la version 1.1.0, une par ligne."
  },
  "changelogV100": "Current month statistics: by color, by opening, rating history, time management, loss causes\nStatistics by opponents' country, with a world map\nLight / dark mode\nApp in English and French",
  "@changelogV100": {
    "description": "Nouveautés de la version 1.0.0, une par ligne."
  },
